{"reviews":[{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-0","r":5.0,"t":"A wonderful product","x":"If I could I would give this more than 5 stars this is a wonderful product and works exactly has described.  This is my second one to purchase for myself, the first one I purchased several years ago and it was still working perfectly but I dropped it on my concrete patio and it hit just right and broke the cap that holds the batteries.  I have given these to friends for presents and they also were very pleased.  I live in Florida and wear sandals all the time so I have very dry heals plus in add","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-1","r":3.0,"t":"May need to work with it a bit to get it to close right","x":"When this micro pedi first arrived I was excited on the speed. However, as I assembled it, I noticed it wasn\u2019t going together correctly. This is my 3rd one. I forgot to pack one while in an extend vacation. They are incredible. Anyway, this one requirement a bit of  finesse been trying to attach the battery compartment.  So when you want to secure the bottom section (preventing the battery from falling out and provinding power to the unit) you have to turn the bottom part on an awkward angle. I ","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-2","r":5.0,"t":"Very nicely made","x":"I am hardly impressed with home products, but this one was outstanding. The finishing of the product is great, simple to use and very effective. One use and I became a fan. The key is just let the roller do its job and do not press it hard against the skin. Just a light touch is what is needed for it to work on the skin. It s not hear to remove cracks in your skin completely, but it will definitely smooth them out.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-3","r":5.0,"t":"This item works well.","x":"I ordered two of these as gifts but also have an older model for myself.  I like the new design and the product does a great job in smoothing calluses and rough spots on your feet. Easy to use and I like options in the wheels.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality!","x":"Best micro-pedi callus remover on the market! This is my second purchase - my first one lasted 10+ years!  Well worth the money, don\u2019t waste your money on any other callus remover!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-5","r":5.0,"t":"A great purchase","x":"I purchased this as a Christmas gift. I have one just like it and I use it as well as my husband.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-6","r":5.0,"t":"Great product! Really works","x":"I already have one and love it. Bought two more for my sister's for their Birthday. No complains!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-7","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"Dead skin flies everywhere and it not caught in a well as earlier version of model.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-8","r":5.0,"t":"Works great","x":"If I use regularly, this really keeps my heals in check.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-9","r":5.0,"t":"Works great","x":"Bought a couple for gifts. Everyone loved it!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-10","r":5.0,"t":"It works!  It\u2019s great!","x":"My husband and I both love the micro pedi callous remover by emjoi.  This is the second one we have purchased. The first one lasted for many years but finally did not work properly because the connection with the battery and the battery case closure became poor.  It works wonderfully for our dry cracked feet, heels and calluses. It is easy and safe to use.   I recommend this product, and would definitely buy it again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-11","r":5.0,"t":"The Best one out there!","x":"I bought a bunch of kits from Costco a couple of years ago when they were marked down, and I've been sold on this product every since. It truly rivals all callus removers I've tried. I would defiantly use it outside, otherwise you will feel like you're in a snow globe in your house...it works that good!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-12","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful","x":"This is by far the best pedi tool out there. I had one that lasted 4 years and I just replaced it with this new one and could not be happier with the quality. I use it during the summer daily as I wear sandals . And weekly during the winter . Buy the replacement rollers so you have them around.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-13","r":5.0,"t":"BUY THIS ONE!","x":"This is my second micro-pedi.  My last one gave out after 10 years of hard use.  Don't bother with the drug store imitations.  This is the original and the best.  I have foot issues and must keep my feet as callus free as possible.  This does it safely and quickly.  Easy to use.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-14","r":5.0,"t":"Get it...it's awesome.","x":"I have own one for three years. And it is awesome. all you have to do is order new sand rollers. I did just this month ago. But it took three years to buy it..that's how long it lasted...I love it so much I order one for daughter. And she love it. Oder it, you won't regret it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-15","r":5.0,"t":"Easy to use and your feet look and feel great!","x":"Nothing to dislike about this product.  It is my second one.  The first lasted about 10 years.  All I had to buy was the pumice rolls.  They last according to how much you use it.  I used it once a week.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-16","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE THIS PRODUCT","x":"Bought the same product from QVC years ago. When a replacement was needed, I wasn't happy about the increased price point so I checked Amazon. WOW! Great value. I highly recommend this product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-17","r":5.0,"t":"Gives you soft feet","x":"Love love love. I absolutely love this! My feet are super smooth after uSe and there is no damage. I have owned one previously and o appreciate the multiple replacement heads.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-18","r":5.0,"t":"Daily user","x":"I suffer from really dry skin that gets itchy at times. This device worked way better than my pedi egg ever did! I'm amazed at the results that I had. I try to use it daily","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-19","r":5.0,"t":"great product","x":"I had one of these for years and then it stopped working.  I purchased another because I found it an important appliance as I got older.  Keeps feet from getting rough","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-20","r":5.0,"t":"Give this product a try... you will be hooked!","x":"Received this as a gift. Loved it so much that I purchased several to give as gifts. Long lasting product that works beautifully. And, it\u2019s actually fun to use.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-21","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!!!!!!","x":"Absolutely love this..I use it every few days to help with dry heals. Easy to use batteries last forever. I am on my second one, wouldn't be without it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-22","r":5.0,"t":"My feet are dancing again!","x":"This is my second unit in about 12 years. I think this is about the kindest way to take care of your feet. It works exactly as advertised.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-23","r":5.0,"t":"Summer must have!","x":"I bought this product from another company and paid a lot more for It! It keeps my feet pedicure soft and sandal ready! Love my Emjoi!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B01IPXUIDC-24","r":4.0,"t":"Nice do it yourself pedicure","x":"Was as expected. Not strong enough for heavily calloused feet. Rollers don't last as long as I'd like. Great idea though...","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers overwhelmingly say the product works well and effectively removes calluses and rough skin.","cites":[1,3,4,7,9,10,11,12,13,14]},{"text":"Many reviewers are repeat buyers or buy it as gifts, often noting their previous unit lasted many years.","cites":[1,2,5,6,7,10,11,13,14,15]},{"text":"Reviewers praise the build quality and ease of use.","cites":[3,4,5,13,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers note that dead skin flies everywhere and isn't well contained.","cites":[8,12]},{"text":"Some reviewers mention needing finesse to assemble or get it to close correctly.","cites":[2]}]},"qa":[]}